### Evaluation, calibration and QA tooling

- [abhixhek/jevcal](https://github.com/abhixhek/jevcal) {{s:abhixhek/jevcal}} — **Stop guessing thresholds.** It fits per-question thresholds on your labels, verifies them on held-out data, and fails CI when a model update breaks them. Cited in more "best practice" sections than any other tool.
- [sutro-sh/jev-align](https://github.com/sutro-sh/jev-align) {{s:sutro-sh/jev-align}} — Builds calibrated "AI functions" from human feedback, using active labelling plus GEPA to optimize the questions.
